WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.500
Most AI gives you a reply. Aselius gives you the work.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:16.050
Aselius is agentic infrastructure software, run by specialized Rivine engines. Every result is a real file you can inspect, edit and export.

3
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:23.800
Everything lives in one sidebar: your workspaces, Connector, Selius, Automations, Observability, Credits and Manage Teams.

4
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:33.150
Inside a workspace, Taskspace is where work happens: the conversation on the left, the Preview Panel on the right.

5
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:44.900
Choose the Rivine engine for the job: TaskForce, Research, Code, Cicero, Creative, Confluence, Assist or Browse. The engine you pick is the engine that runs.

6
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:53.850
Set the engine and its specialty, then send. Or start from an Agent Note that already has both.

7
00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:02.000
Every step shows as it happens. Stop it any time; the trail stays with the thread.

8
00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:10.150
Before it acts in your apps, you approve the exact action. Nothing runs until you do.

9
00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.900
If it needs you, it asks one question and waits.

10
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:24.450
One turn. A whole launch kit: documents, data, media and the app, each one a real file.

11
00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:33.000
Open any file exactly as generated: Word as pages, Excel as a grid, decks slide by slide.

12
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:38.350
Edit with Rivine Assist. Then save, publish or export.

13
00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:46.500
Publish a snapshot with its own access code. Later edits stay private until you update it.

14
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:53.850
It opens on any device. No sign-in. Exactly as generated, with a Download button.

15
00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:59.600
Automations run on a schedule, even with your computer off.

16
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:11.750
Use Aselius from any AI app. Connect Claude, Cursor or ChatGPT to Aselius MCP at workspace.beunec.com/mcp.

17
00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:25.100
The same engines, wherever you work: the web app, Rivine Browse, the Rivine Code CLI, Aselius MCP, your chat apps, and Selius by voice. One wallet across every surface.

18
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:34.050
Not another Claude Cowork, ChatGPT Work or Kimi Work. Specialized engines, real deliverables, and you stay in control.

19
00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:39.800
Aselius. Agentic infrastructure software, at aselius.beunec.com.
